    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully destructible/moldable voxel terrain (each voxel supports smooth/blocky/or a variety of specific shapes) with near-infinite height and breadth.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A procedurally generated infinite world featuring diverse biomes and unique landscapes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WIP (Work in Progress):</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vehicles:</strong> Car could fly by turn on rocket power</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Day-night cycle</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully destructible/moldable voxel terrain (each voxel supports smooth/blocky/or a variety of specific shapes) with near-infinite height and breadth.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A procedurally generated infinite world featuring diverse biomes and unique landscapes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WIP (Work in Progress):</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vehicles:</strong> Car could fly by turn on rocket power</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Day-night cycle</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Dig, Build, Explore! In this sandbox survival game, venture through a vast procedurally-generated infinite world. Mine resources, construct your homestead, craft and drive vehicles, delve into mining, cultivate, livestock, automated machinery, and uncover the truth behind the world.",
